BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 40 756 Td (Abstract Syntax Tree) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 742 Td (The parser converts tokens into typed AST nodes such as Program, VarDecl, Assignment,) Tj ET
