BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 714 Td (preserving program structure and source locations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 40 696 Td (Symbol Table and Lexical Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 682 Td (Scope objects form a parent-linked chain. Lookup searches the active scope and then its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 668 Td (parents. Same-scope duplicates are rejected and nested declarations may shadow outer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 654 Td (names.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 40 636 Td (Three-Address Code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 622 Td (TACInstruction stores op, arg1, arg2, and result. Temporaries such as t1 and labels such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 608 Td (as L1 make expression evaluation and control flow explicit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 40 590 Td (Optimization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 576 Td (- Constant folding evaluates known arithmetic and comparisons at compile time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 562 Td (- Constant propagation substitutes known values into later TAC operands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 548 Td (- Algebraic simplification handles identities such as x + 0 and x * 1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 534 Td (- Dead-code elimination removes instructions after unconditional jumps in linear TAC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 520 Td (- For technical accuracy, explain that CFG-aware data-flow and runtime-error preservation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.1 0.1 0.1 rg 40 506 Td (remain improvement areas.) Tj ET
